## What we do

- [NixOS consulting](https://applicative.systems/services/): fitting NixOS into existing organizations and processes
- [Secure software supply chains](https://applicative.systems/services/build-infrastructure/): reproducible builds, air-gapped build farms, compliance evidence
- [Embedded systems](https://applicative.systems/services/embedded-systems/): NixOS appliance images and over-the-air updates
- [NixOS integration testing](https://applicative.systems/services/test-driver/): we maintain the NixOS test driver in nixpkgs and wrote the [unofficial manual](https://applicative.systems/nixos-test-driver-manual/)

